6d08-5d0a-83da-4e5fb19c78b2" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333166 1034 "The critical points lie on the hyperbola ${u}^{2}-{v}^{2}=1.$" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333166 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535136 true] [17592186333166 1111 #uuid "d7a64d53-7547-501b-a8af-b695293dca5a" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333167 1017 #edb/ref 17592186333168 13194139535136 true] [17592186333167 1089 "q-38245" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333167 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535136 true] [17592186333167 1100 "Find the locations of all of the critical points of the transformation $T,$ where $T$ is defined as \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}{u}^{2}+{v}^{2} \\\\ {u}^{2}-{v}^{2}\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333167 1113 #uuid "48feab89-768b-5b8e-8c0a-02f86fdff070" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333167 1145 "Given a transformation \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}x(u,v) \\\\ y(u,v)\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the locations of the critical points of $T,$ we need to solve \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.\n$$\n\nHere, we have $x(u,v)={u}^{2}+{v}^{2}$ and $y(u,v)={u}^{2}-{v}^{2}.$ \n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =2u & \\,\\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =2v \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =2u & \\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =-2v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2u & 2v \\\\ 2u & -2v\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2u\\cdot (-2v)-2v\\cdot 2u \\\\  & =-4uv-4uv \\\\  & =-8uv.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function has critical points when $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.$ So, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =0 \\\\ -8uv & =0 \\\\ uv & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation $uv=0$ defines the pair of intersecting lines $u=0$ and $v=0$ in the $uv$-plane. Notice that these lines correspond to the coordinate axes in the $uv$-plane." 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333169 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333170 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333171 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333172 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1000 #edb/ref 17592186333173 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1041 "selection" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1104 #edb/ref 17592186333171 13194139535136 true] [17592186333168 1110 #uuid "14a83e38-7775-590f-a49f-70dd043e72f3" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333169 1034 "The critical points lie on the lines $u+v=1.$" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333169 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535136 true] [17592186333169 1111 #uuid "5ccadb85-e113-51b9-bce1-daf966881d91" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333170 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $u-v=1.$" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333170 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535136 true] [17592186333170 1111 #uuid "af3257b3-522c-5156-ad27-7ec5fe374536" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333171 1034 "The critical points lie on the lines $u=0$ and $v=0.$" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333171 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535136 true] [17592186333171 1111 #uuid "ef1060b0-1c79-5ac4-ae60-79e90d2cf792" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333172 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $u=-v.$" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333172 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535136 true] [17592186333172 1111 #uuid "117a3787-4689-50b2-8d5e-b089cef5ea75" 13194139535136 true] [17592186333173 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $u=v.